# COPY . . must never pick up host-side build/dev artifacts: a stale host
# node_modules (built for the host libc/node) silently overwrites the fresh
# in-image npm install and breaks the build or runtime in ways that differ
# per node (bit classguard-1 on the 0.17.5 rollout; the peer, with a clean
# tree, built the same commit fine).
node_modules
dist
